{"type":"text","timestamp":1794298591478,"sessionID":"ses_e3b7f065fffe7TzIV2NKNcShcj","part":{"id":"prt_1c4877f08001rK0rdm0Qp33PQc","sessionID":"ses_e3b7f065fffe7TzIV2NKNcShcj","messageID":"msg_1c48777ef001QEwqniE5qFZsBK","type":"text","text":"All 3 tests pass. Here's what was wrong and how each file was fixed:\n\n| Bug | Root Cause | Fix |\n|-----|-----------|-----|\n| `to_cents(\"19.99\")` → 1998 | `int(float(\"19.99\") * 100)` truncates via floating-point imprecision | Use `Decimal` for exact conversion |\n| Tax on 1999¢ → 399¢ | `// 100` floors instead of rounding half-up | Use `Decimal.quantize(ROUND_HALF_UP)` |\n| Discounted net_cents → 3000 (no discount applied) | Discount was subtracted from the final total in `total()`, not per-line before tax | Apply discount per-line (rounded half-up), then compute tax on each discounted net, sum them for `net_cents()` and `tax_cents()` |","time":{"start":1794298576648,"end":1794298591478}}}
